{
  "title": "Misión de Luca: la entrada, contada",
  "description": "docs/quests/luca.md § Told coming in. What the mission is, said as they come into the basilica in three looks of the camera and six short lines (Fran, the queue, the moths); a colour won back seen going out of the door; the camera coming close to a zone's foes. Run it with --gpu.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "open": "/?mission=luca&part=door"
    },
    {
      "eval": "navigator.getGamepads = () => []"
    },
    {
      "until": "window.gerard && document.querySelector('#environment .place-name').textContent === 'Sagrada Família'",
      "timeout": 120000
    },
    {
      "wait": 1500
    },
    {
      "teleport": "sagrada-familia-interior",
      "cell": [
        36,
        38
      ],
      "settle": 900
    },
    {
      "hold": [
        "KeyW",
        "KeyD"
      ],
      "until": "!!document.querySelector('#hud[data-dialogue]')",
      "timeout": 15000
    },
    {
      "shot": "entrada-fran",
      "delay": 1800,
      "caption": "Just in, first look: the camera goes to Fran under the canopy, his back to everyone, the chaplain before him. Gerard names him"
    },
    {
      "press": "KeyE"
    },
    {
      "shot": "entrada-fran-2",
      "delay": 700,
      "caption": "…and Aitor says what he has done with the basilica"
    },
    {
      "press": "KeyE"
    },
    {
      "wait": 1200
    },
    {
      "until": "!!document.querySelector('#hud[data-dialogue]')",
      "timeout": 15000
    },
    {
      "shot": "entrada-cola",
      "delay": 1200,
      "caption": "Second look: the queue of grey visitors that keeps the way to him"
    },
    {
      "press": "KeyE"
    },
    {
      "wait": 1200
    },
    {
      "until": "!!document.querySelector('#hud[data-dialogue]')",
      "timeout": 15000
    },
    {
      "shot": "entrada-polillas",
      "delay": 1200,
      "caption": "Third look: the moths by the reception desk, eating a colour"
    },
    {
      "press": "KeyE"
    },
    {
      "shot": "entrada-polillas-2",
      "delay": 700,
      "caption": "Aitor: what Luca is missing is in here, in pieces"
    },
    {
      "press": "KeyE"
    },
    {
      "shot": "entrada-polillas-3",
      "delay": 700,
      "caption": "Gerard: piece by piece, up to Fran. The mission, said by them in six short lines"
    },
    {
      "skipDialogue": true
    },
    {
      "wait": 1800
    },
    {
      "shot": "entrada-fin",
      "delay": 400,
      "caption": "The camera back on Gerard, the moths three steps ahead"
    },
    {
      "eval": "window.gerard.storyEvent({ type: 'battle', won: true, encounter: 'luca-recepcion' })"
    },
    {
      "record": "color-sale",
      "seconds": 3.4,
      "fps": 20,
      "tiles": 8,
      "caption": "The reception won: its colour, blue, rises where the moths were and goes out of the Nativity door to Luca, the camera with it"
    },
    {
      "until": "!!document.querySelector('#hud[data-dialogue]')",
      "timeout": 15000
    },
    {
      "shot": "cola-avanza",
      "delay": 1500,
      "caption": "Then the camera turns to the nave's queue, moved on, while Aitor says where the colour went"
    },
    {
      "skipDialogue": true
    },
    {
      "wait": 1600
    },
    {
      "eval": "window.gerard.storyEvent({ type: 'battle', won: true, encounter: 'luca-sillones' })"
    },
    {
      "until": "!!document.querySelector('#hud[data-dialogue]')",
      "timeout": 20000
    },
    {
      "skipDialogue": true
    },
    {
      "wait": 1600
    },
    {
      "teleport": "sagrada-familia-interior",
      "cell": [
        36,
        8
      ],
      "settle": 900
    },
    {
      "hold": [
        "KeyW",
        "KeyD"
      ],
      "until": "!!document.querySelector('#hud[data-dialogue]')",
      "timeout": 15000
    },
    {
      "shot": "carta-zoom",
      "delay": 1800,
      "caption": "Walking up to a zone's foes the camera comes close while they are named: La carta de colores and Luca's shirts"
    }
  ]
}
